## 4. Root Motion Extraction

* **Displacement Decoupling:**
  Extract root bone $(X, Z)$ horizontal displacement and yaw rotation $\Delta 	heta$ per animation frame into movement delta vectors.
* **Physics Character Controller Handoff:**
  Apply horizontal delta directly to character controller velocity:
  $$\mathbf{v}_{	ext{controller}} = 
rac{\Delta \mathbf{P}_{	ext{root}}}{\Delta t}$$
  Keep root bone anchored at $(0, 0, 0)$ in the local visual mesh to eliminate foot-sliding during walking and running.
